# Anchored to repo root so build artefact `./helixllm` is ignored,
# but the `cmd/helixllm/` source directory remains trackable
# (round-95 CONST-046 i18n migration added a test file there).
/helixllm

# round-295 — stray `go build ./challenges/runner/` artefact at
# repo root if the runner is built without -o. Source under
# `challenges/runner/` remains trackable; only the root binary
# named `runner` is ignored (anchored).
/runner

# Phase-4 vision (VLM) boot harness — `go build ./cmd/visiongen-boot/`
# without -o (or the vision_boot_test.sh helper) drops the built binary
# at the repo root as `./visiongen-boot`. Source under
# `cmd/visiongen-boot/` remains trackable; only the root-level binary
# is ignored (anchored), per §11.4.30 no-versioned-build-artifacts.
/visiongen-boot
